2026-07-27T10:18:29.4924889Z i /tmp/RtmpSYHEsP/duckdb
2026-07-27T10:18:29.4925380Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T10:18:29.4925984Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:18:29.4926486Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:18:29.4927288Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:18:29.4928546Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:18:29.4929844Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
